      "value": "After a good amount of testing I found out that the Stiffness value was the trigger for me. On 0.9 it flickers, but on 0.1 it doesn't. Also the arm flicker i was observing does not seem to be related. Big thanks to Lifeinsteps for helping me investigate this issue. I would also like if people could comment if they had the same issue and this fixed it for them too.",
