      "value": "@{5a48b359ee571525fdbed59e|full_name}: Are you using the desktop client or the vr client? Also if you cap the framerate to 60fps or lower (using nvidiainspector for example) we could see if this is the same issue. If it stops flickering on low framerates it is most likely related to this issue. If it does not stop flickering, it will not be directly related to this issue. I have heared that there are some weird problems with dynamic bones on the desktop client. I do not know what problems there are exactly on the desktop client since i don't use it.",
